# direct.list — 公共直连（Clash: DIRECT；Shadowrocket: DIRECT）
# 格式：Surge/Shadowrocket classical（不带策略），subconverter 与 Shadowrocket RULE-SET 通用
# 注意：域名规则必须写在任何 IP/CIDR 之前，否则 asdlokj1qpi23/subconverter 会丢弃后面的域名条目。

# --- JetBrains：IDE 更新 / Marketplace 下载不走不稳定的代理路径 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jetbrains.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jetbrains.com.cn

# --- Kiro / OpenCode / OpenCode Go ---
# OpenCode Go 官方 API 为 https://opencode.ai/inference/go，与 OpenCode 同域（PROCESS-NAME 只在电脑端 Script 里）
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kiro.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kiro.aws.dev
DOMAIN,q.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,q.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,opencode.ai

# --- Trae CN（官方社区白名单：*.trae.cn / *.trae.com.cn / *.mchost.guru / *.zijieapi.com / *.bytedanceapi.com）---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,trae.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,trae.com.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mchost.guru
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zijieapi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytedanceapi.com

# --- WorkBuddy / CodeBuddy / Qoder 国内服务 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,workbuddy.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,codebuddy.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qoder.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qoder.com.cn
DOMAIN,lingma-api.tongyi.aliyun.com
DOMAIN,qoder.console.aliyun.com
DOMAIN,marketplace.lingma.aliyun.com

# --- Steam 下载 CDN 直连（登录/商店/社区走代理，见 steam.list）---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steamcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steampipe.steamcontent.com

# --- Oracle Cloud 注册走直连，避免风控把代理 IP 判成可疑 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oracle.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oraclecloud.com

# --- 局域网 / 内网 ---
IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,127.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,169.254.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,no-resolve
